## Generated into the project's wwwroot by the sass and webpack build steps. The hand written
## BackOffice/Common/**/*.html beside them IS source and is tracked.
##
## Because these are generated and ignored, a build that has not run `yarn build` produces a
## package with no styles and no script. The csproj fails the pack in that case rather than
## shipping one - see the VerifySignatureFieldAssets target.
src/Integrious.Umbraco.Forms.SignatureField/wwwroot/App_Plugins/UmbracoFormsSignatureField/BackOffice/Css/
src/Integrious.Umbraco.Forms.SignatureField/wwwroot/App_Plugins/UmbracoFormsSignatureField/FrontEnd/
